OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVictims 'grossly failed' by sex
OL,4,Aoffender bail decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on BBC Radio 4's Today,
OL,7,Fcommissioner Andrea Simon said the case
OL,8,Fshowed "the justice system did not
OL,9,Fcentre victims" and called for a
OL,10,Fmulti-agency review.
OL,12,FThe government said the law was clear
OL,13,Fthat bail "should only be used where
OL,14,Fnecessary and proportionate, including
OL,15,Fto protect victims".
